OL,3,APoundland supplier 'will lose millions'
OL,4,Aif retailer collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major Poundland supplier has said it
OL,7,Fwill lose millions of pounds if the
OL,8,Fretailer goes bust.
OL,10,FAdam Turner, sales director at
OL,11,FBradford-based Highcrest Retail Brands,
OL,12,Fsaid Poundland was one of its biggest
OL,13,Fcustomers and its collapse would cost
OL,14,Fit "a few million" in lost sales.
OL,16,FPoundland's owner, US-based investment
OL,17,Ffirm Gordon Brothers, is facing
OL,18,Fgovernment scrutiny after refusing a
OL,19,Fbid which would have kept the retailer
OL,20,Fin business.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
