OL,3,APoundland supplier 'will lose millions'
OL,4,Aif retailer collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon Brothers has previously said
OL,7,FPoundland faces multiple economic
OL,8,Fchallenges from rising inflation,
OL,9,Fincreasing staff costs, and "severe
OL,10,Flevels of shoplifting".
